GIBBS FREE ENERGY
-------------------

The Gibbs free energy is G = H - T*S

Total enthalpy                    ...    -56.95707831 Eh 
Total entropy correction          ...     -0.02344825 Eh    -14.71 kcal/mol
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Final Gibbs free energy         ...    -56.98052656 Eh

